   suspension thread  → rod cylinder r=0.02                          black
   sample tube        → CylinderGeometry(0.28,0.28,3.4) + hemisphere glass #CFE6E8 transmissive
   tube lip ring      → TorusGeometry(0.32,0.05)                     glass
   blue sample        → CylinderGeometry(0.26,0.26,2.21)+hemisphere  #6B83E8, meniscus #93A9F2
   pan cords (x3)     → rod cylinders r=0.015                        black
