   pole collars (x2)  → CylinderGeometry(0.82,0.82,0.25) rot z=π/2   steel
   gap field arrows   → TubeGeometry straight + ConeGeometry heads   purple #8A3FD1
   fringing arcs      → TubeGeometry on CatmullRomCurve3 (6 up/6 dn) purple
